      "key": "A02",
      "findings": "PamelaDamnela; Reddit 1n9da6u, 2025-09-05; score 4, material_positive=false/not_interpreted, observation time unavailable. Owns but always skips an intolerable-feeling item; parent context resolves this to the Dr. Idriss exfoliator, alongside love for its baste balm. SKU/version not fully specified. No Experiment acquisition or adverse-use testimony, return or explicit completed routine substitution. Parent RowanVC’s Experiment praise and layered Dr. Idriss experience remain separate testimony. Independence posture unavailable."
    },
    {
      "key": "A04",
      "findings": "Junip customer 202931541; review 7540631, published 2025-03-22, updated 2025-03-23; credited origin; 0 up/0 down, observation time unavailable. Four explicit Experiment acquisition categories: Super Saturated after sister introduction and liking it; Buffer Jelly for greater nighttime hydration/repair; face wash after favorable preceding experience; mesh moisturizer immediately upon launch. Wash and moisturizer correspond contextually to Plasma Wash and Molecular Mesh, but body does not give those exact names; versions unknown. Reports pre-makeup lightweight, refreshing, fast-drying hydration without clogged-feeling pores; glowy/clean skin after Jelly despite initial thick/oily concern; makeup removal, hydration and no more breakouts with wash. Multiple-product routine prevents isolated attribution. Loves packaging colors, without explicit buying causation. No same-product repurchase or stock-up established; makeup-remover redundancy is not narrated discontinuation. Metadata separately identifies Super Saturated Refill, verified buyer, unrewarded and Combo + Sensitive skin; refill metadata adds no acquisition category."
    },
    {
      "key": "A05",
      "findings": "Junip customer 44968672; review 1569510, 2022-11-03, updated same date; credited origin; 0 up/0 down, observation time unavailable. Explicit immediate checkout of reusable Avant Guard after TikTok-creator discovery amid sustainability concerns. Had already stopped formerly near-nightly disposable sheet masks; no explicit completed replacement or future substitution commitment. Uses mask, finds cleaning easy and fit almost perfect except cheeks/nose; motivates use of other hydrating/moisturizing products credited with barrier repair, so mask-alone efficacy is unestablished. One Experiment acquisition category; no gift, repurchase, stockpile or return. Metadata separately identifies Acid Lime/SMALL, verified buyer and unrewarded; formula/version unknown."
    },
    {
      "key": "A12",
      "findings": "eratch; Reddit 1i30kik, 2025-01-16; score 12, material_positive=false/not_interpreted, observation time unavailable; independence posture unavailable. Thread title resolves brand to Regimen Lab. Reports acquiring cream 2.0 seeking a healing moisturizer after excessive tret use and also picking up cleanser. Favorable cream experience supports intention to try more; cleanser is nice but small, with greater interest in serums/moisturizers. Science/formulation praise is personal assessment. These are other-brand acquisitions and prospective interest, not Experiment buying, proven healing, repurchase or completed routine replacement. Context post supplies brand reference only; its author, date and engagement are unavailable."
    }
